          "value": "<p><strong>Lost template ability</strong> (CR +1). The first time damage would reduce this creature to 0 hit points, it is reduced to 1 hit point instead, then regains hit points equal to 1d12 + its Constitution modifier, and gains one Shadowlands power of the GM's selection. It cannot use this ability again until it completes a long rest or kills a living creature.</p>",
